  "description": "Click here and download the Retro Story font · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Step back into the grooviest era with Retro Story! Designed as a bold, bubbly display retro font, it features soft flared stems, playful wavy silhouettes, and plump vintage letterforms inspired by classic 70s nostalgia. Its cheerful aesthetic and chunky weight bring instant personality, fun energy, and high-impact style to any display header.\n\nIdeal for 70s retro apparel, sticker packs, summer party posters, kids’ book titles, groovy quote graphics, event banners, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
